WEBVTT

00:02:56.925 --> 00:03:02.012
gives me the opportunity
to continue my cracking ambition --

00:03:02.036 --> 00:03:03.520
(Laughter)

00:03:03.544 --> 00:03:07.879
to connect this concrete land
back to nature.

00:03:10.053 --> 00:03:13.280
Before, Thais -- my people --

00:03:13.304 --> 00:03:19.182
we were adapted to the cycle
of the wet and dry season,

00:03:19.206 --> 00:03:22.920
and you could call us amphibious.

00:03:22.944 --> 00:03:23.945
(Laughter)

00:03:23.969 --> 00:03:26.245
We lived both on land and on water.

00:03:26.841 --> 00:03:29.254
We were adapted to both.